    "# Quiz: History of machine learning\n",
    "\n",
    "> **On Alps:** These are the questions of this lesson's pre-lecture and post-lecture quizzes, from the course's quiz app, with the answers the quiz app accepts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-2-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Approximately when was the term 'artificial intelligence' coined?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>1980s</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The 1980s were the time of expert systems. The term was coined earlier, at the 1956 Dartmouth project.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>1950s</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. The term 'artificial intelligence' was coined at the Dartmouth Summer Research Project in 1956.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>1930s</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. That is too early. The term was coined in 1956, at the Dartmouth Summer Research Project.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-2-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Who was one of the early pioneers of machine learning?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Alan Turing</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Alan Turing is credited with helping lay the foundation for the idea of a 'machine that can think.'</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Bill Gates</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The pioneer in this history is Alan Turing. He helped lay the foundation for the idea of a machine that can think.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Shakey the robot</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Shakey was not a person. It was one of the early intelligent machines built during the 'golden years.'</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-2-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is one of the reasons that advancement in AI slowed in the 1970s?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Limited compute power</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Compute power was too limited for what AI had promised, so funding dried up and the field slowed.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Not enough skilled engineers</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The reasons given for the slowdown include too little compute power and too little data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Conflicts between countries</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The 'AI Winter' came from issues like compute power that was too limited and a lack of data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Post-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-2-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What's an example of a 'scruffy' AI system?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>ELIZA</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. ELIZA was a well-known 'scruffy' system. Scruffy labs tweaked programs for hours until they got the results they wanted.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>HACKML</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The well-known 'scruffy' systems were ELIZA and SHRDLU.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>SSYSTEM</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The 'scruffy' systems named in this history are ELIZA and SHRDLU.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-2-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is an example of a technology that was developed during 'The Golden Years'?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Blocks world</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Blocks world was a 'micro-world' from the golden years, where blocks could be stacked and sorted.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Jibo</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Machines from the golden years include Shakey the robot, the chatbot Eliza and Blocks world.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Robot dogs</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The golden-years examples are Shakey the robot, Eliza and Blocks world. Robot dogs are not among them.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-2-post-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Which event was foundational in the creation and expansion of the field of artificial intelligence?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Turing Test</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The Turing Test was Alan Turing's way to look for evidence of a thinking machine. The key event was the Dartmouth project.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Dartmouth Summer Research Project</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. The 1956 Dartmouth project was a key event for AI as a field, and the term 'artificial intelligence' was coined there.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>AI Winter</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The AI Winter was a slowdown, when funding dried up and confidence in AI fell.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  }
